      "writtenOn": "2024-03-28T04:19:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Maybe we could check the gid directly, before spawning virtmgr?\n\nWould you mean GID for the test app(`MicrodroidTestAppNoPerm`)? I think it depends on having definition or not in `AndroidTest.xml`.\n\nOn the other hand, do we have any reason to use java APIs in AVF w/o `MANAGE_VIRTUAL_MACHINE` permission? Or, I think we may need to define a new permission granting `SYS_NICE` only, which leads to use java APIs in AVF..?",
      "parentUuid": "6f681d24_0ce35c09",
      "revId": "d658c51732e3691f0a5c5b29562044cf40751dff",
